{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Site Management Simulator</strong> is a detailed management game where you\u2019ll rise from managing a small apartment to running a massive residential complex. From cleaning to security, maintenance fees to decoration \u2014 you control it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Start Small, Rule Big</strong><br>Begin with just a few apartments, gradually purchase new buildings, and expand your site. Every block is under your control \u2014 maintain order, solve problems, and unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Manage Your Staff</strong><br>Hire workers to keep the environment clean, organize spaces, collect trash, and make everything shine. The happier the residents are, the more you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Keep Residents Happy</strong><br>Cleanliness, order, new areas, and visual beauty\u2026 Every detail increases resident satisfaction. The higher the happiness, the stronger your reputation and income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Use Your Earnings Wisely</strong><br>Invest your money in new buildings, markets, gyms, pools, and basketball courts. Each new facility generates income and makes your site more attractive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Build the community of your dreams!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903600?t=1760549795","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903600/f3fd8a8dcbef11c807c2f4301b5c943948f30de3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760549795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903600/6980f70efb86f7b7c2a32ef2247bd1c870e36e64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760549795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903600/6980f70efb86f7b7c2a32ef2247bd1c870e36e64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760549795","categories":[{"descri